      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "At ₹399 (NSE close, 23 Nov 2026), a discounted cash flow model with a 10.08% cost of capital matches the price if revenue grows about 20.8% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 15.0%; DABUR's revenue grew 4.9% a year over FY22–FY26.",
